<!--
  The mark for Dictate Cloud: a filled cloud with Dictate's own mic glyph knocked out of it.

  One path with evenOdd rather than a cloud plus a mic drawn on top, because this icon is tinted
  wherever it appears — a second colour would survive only until the first theme change. The mic
  coordinates are pre-transformed into this viewport for the same reason: a <group> transform cannot
  take part in the even-odd rule that cuts the hole.

  Solid rather than outlined on purpose. At 24dp the outlined version's mic stand turned to mush,
  and this mark has to stay legible in a Smartbar chip and a settings row alike.

  The mic sits at scale 0.42 with its centre at y 12.8 rather than geometrically centred in the
  cloud. Centred by the numbers it read as sitting too low, because the cloud's own mass is in its
  flat bottom while the top is a light bump — so the shape's optical centre is above its
  geometric one. Chosen by rendering three variants and looking at them.
-->
